    "summary": "stopDaemon now bounds its shutdown request at 5 seconds, waits as before, and ends a daemon that overruns the wait by SIGKILL, but only a pid whose command line ends in daemon/index.js; it removes the pid file and socket after a kill and returns how the stop ended. restart reports a forced stop ('force-stop') and goes on to start. The service type and the three callers are updated.",
